  "worked_solution": "We first apply the sum rule, and then apply the constant rule and compute the limits of the power functions:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{lim}_{h\\to \\,0}(-2x-h) & ={lim}_{h\\to \\,0}(-2x)-{lim}_{h\\to \\,0}h \\\\  & =-2x{lim}_{h\\to \\,0}1-{lim}_{h\\to \\,0}h \\\\  & =-2x-0 \\\\  & =-2x\\end{aligned}\n$$",
